<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-16405] NoClassDefFound on invokeAsync when using BinaryObjects.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-16405</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Tx cache async operation may fail with an error on retry in case when the binary projection is used.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This happens due to the lost CacheOperationContext, which holds &apos;keepBinary&apos; flag, on retry and leads to object deserialization when TX is trying to enlist en entry.&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;PFA stacktrace.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
